# Allowlist: this project folder also holds personal photos/videos, an
# unrelated "beautiful people project", and large Blender source/backup
# files that don't belong in the public site repo. Ignore everything by
# default and explicitly un-ignore only what the deployed site needs.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/index.html
!/CLAUDE.md
!/TODO.md
!/web/
!/exports/
!/tools/

# Even inside the tracked folders, never track OS cruft, Blender's own
# backup/lock files, or regenerable Python/texture caches.
.DS_Store
*.blend1
*.blend2
__pycache__/
*.pyc
tools/_texture_cache/
